{"schema_version":2,"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","events":[{"id":"santizhu059-e-sr-deng-testament","title":"孙登临终上疏（全文）","accounts":[{"id":"santizhu059-a-5bc776e8e27ab131544a","label":"正文","text":"孙登临终上疏：陈病惧陨毙；劝权修黄老养神、进用皇子和及诸臣、宽刑轻赋均息力役；既绝而后书闻，权摧感言则陨涕","evidence":["santizhu059-q-bcd6fb6ad46c1588ff93","santizhu059-q-866bbc039a68c791f54b","santizhu059-q-71f3a96039b817f76375","santizhu059-q-1ce9e6fa07e0da0294a4","santizhu059-q-cbe0e87e04f27e0e1082","santizhu059-q-0c18a3c77301c60ef64b","santizhu059-q-8dddb10bce04182153cf","santizhu059-q-4ce824e56ddb6d2c8c2f"]}],"participants":[{"person":"zhouyu-p0025","role":"临终上疏进言","evidence":["santizhu059-q-bcd6fb6ad46c1588ff93","santizhu059-q-866bbc039a68c791f54b","santizhu059-q-71f3a96039b817f76375","santizhu059-q-1ce9e6fa07e0da0294a4","santizhu059-q-cbe0e87e04f27e0e1082","santizhu059-q-0c18a3c77301c60ef64b","santizhu059-q-8dddb10bce04182153cf","santizhu059-q-4ce824e56ddb6d2c8c2f"]},{"person":"sun-quan","role":"闻疏摧感陨涕","evidence":["santizhu059-q-bcd6fb6ad46c1588ff93","santizhu059-q-866bbc039a68c791f54b","santizhu059-q-71f3a96039b817f76375","santizhu059-q-1ce9e6fa07e0da0294a4","santizhu059-q-cbe0e87e04f27e0e1082","santizhu059-q-0c18a3c77301c60ef64b","santizhu059-q-8dddb10bce04182153cf","santizhu059-q-4ce824e56ddb6d2c8c2f"]}],"place":null,"time":{"label":"原文纪年见引文；不换算公元年","precision":"undated","basis":"未由相邻段落推算纪年；原文时间表达保留在来源引句中。","evidence":["santizhu059-q-bcd6fb6ad46c1588ff93","santizhu059-q-866bbc039a68c791f54b","santizhu059-q-71f3a96039b817f76375","santizhu059-q-1ce9e6fa07e0da0294a4","santizhu059-q-cbe0e87e04f27e0e1082","santizhu059-q-0c18a3c77301c60ef64b","santizhu059-q-8dddb10bce04182153cf","santizhu059-q-4ce824e56ddb6d2c8c2f"]},"ordering_evidence":"santizhu059-q-bcd6fb6ad46c1588ff93","source_order":[59,60,0],"order":10437}],"persons":[{"id":"sun-quan","name":"孙权","facts":[],"aliases":[]},{"id":"zhouyu-p0025","name":"孙登","facts":[],"aliases":[]}],"evidence":[{"id":"santizhu059-q-0c18a3c77301c60ef64b","section":"chapter-059","block":"b-5ffabb78848990ad7d1b","layer":"original","quote":"陆逊忠勤于时，出身忧国；謇謇在公〖18〗，有匪躬之节〖19〗。诸葛瑾、步骘、朱然、全琮、朱据、吕岱、吾粲、阚泽、严畯、张承、孙怡，忠于为国〖20〗，通达治体。可令陈上便宜，蠲除苛烦〖21〗；爱养士马，抚循百姓。五年之外，十年之内；远者归复，近者尽力；兵不血刃，而大事可定也。","section_title":"吴主五子传第十四","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0125.xhtml","index":64,"anchor":null},"note_id":null,"start":0,"end":137},{"id":"santizhu059-q-1ce9e6fa07e0da0294a4","section":"chapter-059","block":"b-b2da786af95894709eb1","layer":"original","quote":"皇子和，仁孝聪哲，德行清茂；宜早建置〖9〗，以系民望。诸葛恪，才略博达，器任佐时；张休、顾谭、谢景，皆通敏有识断：入宜委腹心，出可为爪牙。范慎、华融，矫矫壮节〖10〗，有国士之风。羊衜辩捷，有专对之材〖11〗。刁玄优弘，志履道真。裴钦博记，翰采足用〖12〗。蒋修、虞翻，志节分明。凡此诸臣，或宜廊庙〖13〗，或任将帅；皆练时事〖14〗，明习法令，守信固义，有不可夺之志。此皆陛下日月所照，选置臣官，得与从事；备知情素，敢以陈闻。","section_title":"吴主五子传第十四","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0125.xhtml","index":62,"anchor":null},"note_id":null,"start":0,"end":214},{"id":"santizhu059-q-4ce824e56ddb6d2c8c2f","section":"chapter-059","block":"b-bd44692e9ab3e5da5c12","layer":"original","quote":"既绝而后书闻〖24〗，权益以摧感〖25〗，言则陨涕。是岁，赤乌四年也。","section_title":"吴主五子传第十四","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0125.xhtml","index":66,"anchor":null},"note_id":null,"start":0,"end":35},{"id":"santizhu059-q-71f3a96039b817f76375","section":"chapter-059","block":"b-2eb03cbea6a015e50ebf","layer":"original","quote":"方今大事未定，逋寇未讨；万国喁喁，系命陛下；危者望安，乱者仰治。愿陛下弃忘臣身，割下流之恩，修黄、老之术〖7〗；笃养神光，加羞珍膳；广开神明之虑，以定无穷之业。则率土幸赖〖8〗，臣死无恨也！","section_title":"吴主五子传第十四","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0125.xhtml","index":61,"anchor":null},"note_id":null,"start":0,"end":95},{"id":"santizhu059-q-866bbc039a68c791f54b","section":"chapter-059","block":"b-8b20f4297f4ba2ea6fff","layer":"original","quote":"臣以无状〖1〗，婴抱笃疾〖2〗；自省微劣，惧猝陨毙。臣不自惜，念当委离供养，埋胔后土〖3〗；长不复奉望宫省，朝觐日月〖4〗；生无益于国，死贻陛下重戚〖5〗：以此为哽结耳。臣闻死生有命，长短自天。周晋、颜回有上智之才〖6〗，而尚夭折；况臣愚陋，年过其寿？生为国嗣，没享荣祚：于臣已多，亦何悲恨哉！","section_title":"吴主五子传第十四","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0125.xhtml","index":60,"anchor":null},"note_id":null,"start":0,"end":147},{"id":"santizhu059-q-8dddb10bce04182153cf","section":"chapter-059","block":"b-658f526c6c1c50db46d0","layer":"original","quote":"臣闻‘鸟之将死其鸣也哀〖22〗，人之将死其言也善’；故子囊临终〖23〗，遗言戒时，君子以为忠。岂况臣登，其能已乎！愿陛下留意听采，臣虽死之日，犹生之年也！","section_title":"吴主五子传第十四","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0125.xhtml","index":65,"anchor":null},"note_id":null,"start":0,"end":77},{"id":"santizhu059-q-bcd6fb6ad46c1588ff93","section":"chapter-059","block":"b-1a69c953ff66144073fa","layer":"original","quote":"临终，上疏曰：","section_title":"吴主五子传第十四","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0125.xhtml","index":59,"anchor":null},"note_id":null,"start":0,"end":7},{"id":"santizhu059-q-cbe0e87e04f27e0e1082","section":"chapter-059","block":"b-3c3546870936475d7b49","layer":"original","quote":"臣重惟当今方外多虞〖15〗，师旅未休；当厉六军，以图进取。军以人为众，众以财为宝。窃闻郡县颇有荒残，民物凋弊〖16〗，奸乱萌生；是以法令繁滋，刑辟重切〖17〗。臣闻为政听民，律令与时推移；诚宜与将相大臣详择时宜，博采众议，宽刑轻赋，均息力役，以顺民望。","section_title":"吴主五子传第十四","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0125.xhtml","index":63,"anchor":null},"note_id":null,"start":0,"end":126}],"profiles":{},"directory_counts":{}}
